How about:

```go
func ServerMetricsReporting/*??*/() grpc.ServerOption {
	return join(grpc.ChainStreamInterceptor(...), grpc.ChainUnaryInterceptor(...))
}
```

OK so what's that `join`?  We could have an internal-only `ServerOption` that combines any arbitrary server options, or would could even export it for users.

Either way, I think something like that would be a much nicer API.

